
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Welcome to Orbit</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: black;
            color: white;
            font-family: Arial;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            color: purple;
        }

        .box {
            border: 1px solid gray;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .author {
            color: lightgreen;
        }

        .price {
            color: purple;
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: green;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            background-color: orange;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Welcome to Orbit</h1>
    <p>Your new home for all things space.</p>

    <div class="box">

        <h2>Why Your Brain Loves Lo-Fi Beats</h2>

        <p>2 minutes - 3 weeks ago</p>
        <p class="author">Orbit Studio</p>

        <p>Listen to music while studying,
           coding, or relaxing.</p>

        <a href="#" class="btn">Listen Now</a>

        <hr>

        <p>LIVE CONCERT</p>
        <h2>Galaxy Tour 2026</h2>

        <p>Cosmic Arena - Friday, 8:00 PM</p>
        <p class="price">$45</p>
        <p class="author">Orbit Official</p>

        <p>Get ready for an amazing music show!</p>

        <a href="#">Get tickets</a>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Buttons</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: black;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin: 5px;
        }

        .play {
            background-color: green;
        }

        .follow {
            background-color: white;
        }

        .buy {
            background-color: purple;
            color: white;
        }

        .like {
            background-color: pink;
        }

        .download {
            background-color: lightgray;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: orange;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <button class="play">Play Now</button>
    <button class="follow">Follow</button>
    <button class="buy">Buy Ticket</button>
    <button class="like">Like</button>
    <button class="download">Download</button>

</body>
</html>

